k8s/sweep/rbac.sh, red-proofed 2026-11-06 on a throwaway kind cluster (kind v0.32, kindest/node:v1.36.1 pinned
as in k8s/kind-cluster.yaml), named rbac-check with no host ports so the running compose fleet kept its lease.
